THIRD-PARTY DATA

H01 human temporal cortex release (Shapson-Coe et al., Science 384, eadk4858
(2024), doi:10.1126/science.adk4858), CC BY 4.0.
  data/connectomes/h01/stats/connection_stats.json and histograms.json are
  aggregate statistics derived from the c3 synapse export in gs://h01-release
  by scripts/data/h01_stats.py. They remain under CC BY 4.0 with this
  attribution, and are not covered by the Apache License; no synapse-level H01
  data is included.

FlyWire whole-brain connectome, materialization 783 (Dorkenwald et al.,
Nature 634, 124-138 (2024), doi:10.1038/s41586-024-07558-y; Schlegel et al.,
Nature (2024), doi:10.1038/s41586-024-07686-5). Zenodo record 10676866 states
CC BY 4.0; flywire.ai states CC BY-NC 4.0 for the public release.
  FlyWire data, which scripts/data/fetch_flywire.py downloads, is governed by
  FlyWire's own terms, not by the Apache License. Under the flywire.ai terms
  (CC BY-NC 4.0), commercial use of that data needs FlyWire's permission.
  No connectivity table is redistributed.

Files derived from FlyWire data (covered by FlyWire's terms, not by the Apache
License). They hold neuron and synapse counts per cell class of the
mushroom-body subgraph, the SHA-256 of the downloaded files, and the outputs
of simulations run on the FlyWire v783 wiring:
  results/h1/fly_arm.json
  results/fly-gate/brainsim/gate.json
  results/fly-gate/brainsim/gate-attempt-charge-iev275.json
  results/fly-gate/shiu-brian2/gate.json
  docs/figures/data.json and the figures plotted from the files above:
    docs/figures/{png,svg}/capacity-arms*, capacity-ratio*, fly-gate*

The FlyWire cell-type annotations (flyconnectome/flywire_annotations, tag
v2.1.0) carry no licence file. They are downloaded for local use by
scripts/data/fetch_flywire.py and not redistributed.

The Harris lab rat CA1 data (kharris15, ODC-By 1.0) and the MICrONS mouse
visual cortex data (CC BY 4.0) are not redistributed and no script downloads
them.
